# License and Third-Party Code Notice

This repository is a mixed-origin project. **There is currently no single, blanket open-source license for the entire repository.** Do not assume that every file or every section of the combined userscripts may be redistributed under one license.

This notice is provided to identify the licensing status that can currently be established. It does not replace, narrow, or revoke the rights granted by the original authors of third-party material.

## 1. Components with identified upstream GPL licensing

### Steam historical-lowest-price functionality

The wishlist historical-price functionality is based in part on:

- Upstream: [Steam 史低自动查询 (GreasyFork #586080)](https://greasyfork.org/zh-CN/scripts/586080-steam-%E5%8F%B2%E4%BD%8E%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2-%E6%84%BF%E6%9C%9B%E5%8D%95-%E4%B8%AD%E6%97%A5%E5%9C%9F%E7%BE%8E-%E5%8D%95%E5%95%86%E5%93%81%E9%A1%B5-%E4%B8%AD-%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E7%94%B5%E8%84%91%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8)
- Upstream license: **GNU GPL version 3 or any later version (GPL-3.0-or-later)**, as identified on the upstream script page.

The original copyright and license notices for this component must be preserved. Modifications and derivative distributions must comply with the applicable GPL terms.

### Bundle-history indicator functionality

The bundle-history indicator is based in part on the Barter.vg bundle-data and game-card marking functionality from:

- Upstream: [Steam Family Game Analysis (GreasyFork #588235)](https://greasyfork.org/zh-CN/scripts/588235-steam-family-game-analysis-publishable)
- Upstream license: **GPLv3** (the upstream script identifies GPLv3).

The original copyright and license notices for this component must be preserved. Modifications and derivative distributions must comply with the applicable GPLv3 terms.

